# The Go port's package is named "vmaware" (go/pkg/vmaware) and its CLI
# command directory is also named "vmaware" (go/cmd/vmaware); un-ignore them
# specifically since the bare "vm"/"vmaware" patterns above (meant for
# root-level build binaries) would otherwise match at any depth.
!go/pkg/vmaware/
!go/cmd/vmaware/